        "created_at": "2017-04-06T01:49:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This is working as expected if a card reacts on destruction of a card and it's a target it remains in play until that affect finishes. &nbsp;If that card has its own destruction text on then it will retain all of the affects on it until it completes its own destruction text but if it doesn't it loses all game text while this happens.&nbsp;</p>",
